summary:
Last week, I realized I might have a problem.
Too much Youtube.
It always creeps up on me. I see it coming but do it anyway.
Sure, why not&hellip;
It starts with an innocent thought: &ldquo;Hey, it&rsquo;s a long time since I watched some gaming videos.&rdquo;
So I do, and it&rsquo;s fun.
Then I think: &ldquo;Hmm. It wouldn&rsquo;t hurt to install the game and play a game or two.&rdquo;
So I do, and it&rsquo;s even more fun.
